         ("Which transition step came LAST in the historical timeline narrated here?", ["Greek adaptation adding explicit independent vowels.", "Sumerian concrete picture marks for grain jars.", "Semitic reduction inside Sinai desert mines.", "Egyptian scribes discovering rebus phonetic wordplay."], 0, "ITP-MOD-10", "B1", "Tahap terakhir yang dipaparkan adalah penambahan vokal oleh Yunani."),
