         ("Which feature is NOT part of tactical urbanism philosophy as described here?", ["Replacing local input completely with closed-door national highway decrees.", "Teaming planners directly with neighborhood citizens for short weekend builds.", "Gathering real-world street behavior numbers prior to capital granite spending.", "Shrink-testing wide fast car turning corners to slow traffic gently."], 0, "ITP-MOD-10", "B1", "Pendekatan justru melibatkan warga lokal, bukan keputusan sepihak tertutup."),
         ("How is the final transition between pilot testing and permanent sidewalks framed?", ["Pilots inform smarter durable permanent construction once benefits prove out.", "Temporary orange cones remain nailed into roads permanently forever.", "Concrete construction companies ban temporary street chalk nationwide.", "Weekend volunteers tear down permanent brick corners manually."], 0, "ITP-MOD-05", "B2", "Uji sementara memvalidasi desain terlebih dulu sebelum pengecoran trotoar granit permanen."),
