         ("What does the text report regarding modern container lane 'communication bubbles'?", ["Busy shipping corridors have compressed effective listening radii by roughly seventy-plus percent.", "Modern ships actually tripled blue-whale basin calling ranges since 1950.", "Baleen songs remain unmasked across every crowded European harbor.", "Low-frequency channels became entirely silent once diesel turbines vanished."], 0, "ITP-MOD-05", "B2", "Radius komunikasi paus menyusut lebih dari 70% di jalur kargo padat."),
         ("What dual benefit accompanies slowing merchant container ships modestly by two knots?", ["Both sharp underwater acoustic noise reduction and tangible fuel savings.", "Faster port cargo unloading and zero marine hull rust.", "Automatic clearance past rocky Arctic sea ice shelves.", "Complete elimination of coastal fishing trawler sonar pings."], 0, "ITP-MOD-05", "B1", "Melambat dua knot menurunkan suara kavitasi secara drastis sekaligus menghemat bahan bakar."),
